<title>SYRIA: Syria tenders to buy 24,000 tonnes of rice.</title>
<headline>Syria tenders to buy 24,000 tonnes of rice.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Foreign Trade Organisation for Chemicals and Foodstuffs (GEZA) on Monday issued an international tender to buy 24,000 tonnes of white rice for August delivery, a GEZA spokesman said.</p>
<p>He told Reuters that July 23 was set as the final date to submit offers and that results would be made available on July 24.</p>
</text>
